# Panel 245's R1: one verdict at every level. The `warning` call is refused
# by `build` at `-O0` and `-O2` and by `run`, the refusal at `-O2` saying the
# `-O0` compile is what refused it (`cli/region_level.hero`).

extern "lib.h"
    function door(x: i64) -> i64

function main()
    print(door(x: 1))
